<h2 class="l-ui-utility--mt-2xl">Reasoning</h2>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">A collapsible block for displaying streamed reasoning or thinking chunks from an assistant. Uses a native <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> element so it is accessible and works without JavaScript. Place it inside a message bubble, before the body. The chevron rotates when expanded.</p>

<div class="l-ui-surface l-ui-utility--mt-lg">
  <div class="l-ui-message">
    <div class="l-ui-message__avatar">AI</div>
    <div class="l-ui-message__bubble">
      <details class="l-ui-message__reasoning" open>
        <summary class="l-ui-message__reasoning-summary"><%= image_tag "layered_ui/icon_chevron_right.svg", class: "l-ui-icon--sm", alt: "" %> Reasoning</summary>
        <div class="l-ui-message__reasoning-body">
          The user wants to know about error handling in their validation method. Let me consider the edge cases: nil values would raise a NoMethodError on .empty?, and blank strings would pass the regex. I should suggest guard clauses for both cases and recommend more descriptive error messages.
        </div>
      </details>
      <div class="l-ui-message__body">
        I'd recommend adding guard clauses for nil and empty strings before the regex check.
      </div>
      <div class="l-ui-message__footer">
        <div class="l-ui-message__metadata">Claude Opus 4.6 (~42 tokens)</div>
        <div class="l-ui-message__timestamp">2:15 PM</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="l-ui-utility--mt-lg" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button--outline" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View code</button>
  <dialog class="l-ui-modal" data-l-ui--modal-target="dialog" data-action="click->l-ui--modal#closeOnBackdrop" aria-labelledby="modal-conversations-reasoning-heading">
    <div class="l-ui-modal__header">
      <h3 id="modal-conversations-reasoning-heading">Reasoning</h3>
      <button class="l-ui-button--icon" data-action="l-ui--modal#close" aria-label="Close">
        <%= image_tag "layered_ui/icon_close.svg", alt: "", class: "l-ui-icon--sm", aria: { hidden: true } %>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="l-ui-modal__body">
      <pre class="l-ui-surface"><code>&lt;div class="l-ui-message__bubble"&gt;
  &lt;details class="l-ui-message__reasoning"&gt;
    &lt;summary class="l-ui-message__reasoning-summary"&gt;
