<h2 class="l-ui-utility--mt-2xl">Token fade-in</h2>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">Apply <code>l-ui-token-fade</code> to each token as it arrives during streaming. The animation fades each token in over 0.3s with ease-in timing, giving a smooth appearance as text is generated.</p>

<div class="l-ui-surface l-ui-utility--mt-lg">
  <p><span class="l-ui-token-fade">Hello, </span><span class="l-ui-token-fade" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">I'd </span><span class="l-ui-token-fade" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">be </span><span class="l-ui-token-fade" style="animation-delay: 0.3s">happy </span><span class="l-ui-token-fade" style="animation-delay: 0.4s">to </span><span class="l-ui-token-fade" style="animation-delay: 0.5s">help </span><span class="l-ui-token-fade" style="animation-delay: 0.6s">with </span><span class="l-ui-token-fade" style="animation-delay: 0.7s">that.</span></p>
</div>

<div class="l-ui-utility--mt-lg" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button--outline" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View code</button>
